{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Legend of the Crystals: Final Fantasy","Planet R's luminous existence is maintained by four magical Crystals, each regulating a different essential element: Earth, Water, Fire and Wind. Long ago, sinister dark forces stole the Crystals and threatened to destroy the Planet. But, the courageous heroes fought desperately and defeated the dark forces to restore the planet to its peaceful state.\n\n\n\nTwo hundred years later - the great fight has been long forgotten and again, three Crystals have been stolen. The young descendants of the ancient heroes, Linaly and Prettz, are all that remain to protect the Crystal of Wind from the evil forces. If the two can managae to escape from Rouge - the leader of a leather-bound army of female pirates, they must still pass through the many dangerous obstacles that protect the magical crystal. Only the chosen one will survive the passage.\n\n\n\n(Source: Urban Vision)"],"ja":["ファイナルファンタジー",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-426","ids":{"shikimori":426,"mal":426,"anilist":426,"kodik":"serial-26285"},"kodikIds":["serial-7543","serial-24022","serial-26285"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-7543":"2020-01-14T16:56:58Z","serial-24022":"2020-03-22T22:19:38Z","serial-26285":"2020-05-28T11:51:17Z"},"title":"Последняя фантазия: Легенда кристаллов","originalTitle":"Final Fantasy","alt":"Final Fantasy: Legend of the Crystals Legend of the Crystals: Final Fantasy ファイナルファンタジー","description":"Продолжение событий «Последняя фантазия V». Спустя 200 лет после того, как Бартц и его друзья спасли два мира от угрозы, исходившей от Эксдэта, возникает новая опасность, стремящаяся заполучить Кристаллы. Линали Клаузер, потомок Бартца, и её друг и защитник Прицц отправляются в Храм Ветра, чтобы разузнать источник этой новой угрозы.","year":1994,"type":"OVA","genres":["Экшен","Приключения","Комедия","Фэнтези"],"rating":6.12,"popularity":3157,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":